        # 3b540 round 2 (r1 reviews, claude F1+F2 / gemini F1+F2): an EXPLICIT
        # head ref whose floor blob is not valid JSON, or is valid JSON of
        # the wrong shape, refuses with D12 CANNOT-EVALUATE naming the head
